#
# Selection is deterministic in
# `eval/datasets/musique.py::select_chain_question_ids`:
# 1. keep answerable questions only;
# 2. require a strict hop chain where every hop after the first references `#k`;
# 3. require at least three hops and entity-valued intermediate answers;
# 4. reject questions whose text reveals an intermediate answer;
# 5. exclude declared `BROKEN_GOLD` questions and any question sharing at least two
#    hops with that set;
# 6. sort by descending hop count and ID, then greedily reject questions sharing at
#    least two hops with an already selected question.
#
